# 🏗️ The Project — TeamFlow

**TeamFlow** is a Project & Task Management Backend API.

Users can:

* Create and manage projects
* Add project members
* Create and manage tasks
* Assign tasks to members
* Track task status
* Add comments
* Search/filter/sort/paginate tasks
* Receive notifications
* Ask an AI assistant about their projects and tasks

The project grows continuously across all 6 sprints.

